"html": "<h4>Consiliul consultativ</h4>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/profiles/details/victor-velculescu\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Victor-Velculescu-150x150.jpeg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/profiles/details/victor-velculescu\">Victor E. Velculescu, M.D., Ph.D.</a></h3>\n<p>Co-Director of Cancer Genetics and Epigenetics</p><p><a href=\"https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/profiles/details/victor-velculescu\">Professor of Oncology and Pathology at the Johns Hopkins University Kimmel Cancer Center,</a><br/>Baltimore, MD</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://staff.ki.se/people/lars-larsson\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Prof.-Lucian-Chirieac-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://staff.ki.se/people/lars-larsson\">Lucian Radu Chirieac , Professor, M.D.</a></h3>\n<a href=\"https://connects.catalyst.harvard.edu/Profiles/display/Person/41938\">Professor of Pathology, </a><br/><a href=\"https://connects.catalyst.harvard.edu/Profiles/display/Person/41938\">Harvard Medical School</a>Senior Pathologist, Brigham and Women’s HospitalBoston, MA, USA\n<figure><a href=\"https://physiology.med.wayne.edu/profile/ai6873\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Untitled-e1513333331836-150x150-1-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://physiology.med.wayne.edu/profile/ai6873\">Banu P. Jena</a></h3>\n<p>Professor, PhD</p><p><a href=\"https://physiology.med.wayne.edu/profile/ai6873\">Department of Physiology, School of Medicine, Wayne State University</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.cce.caltech.edu/people/rudolph-a-rudy-marcus\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/RAM_2-150x150-1.jpeg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://www.cce.caltech.edu/people/rudolph-a-rudy-marcus\">Rudolph A. Marcus</a></h3>\n<p>Kirkwood-Noyes Professor, <br/>Professor of Chemistry</p><p>Division of Chemistry and Chemical Engineering</p><p><a href=\"https://www.cce.caltech.edu/people/rudolph-a-rudy-marcus\">California Institute of Technology</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cce.caltech.edu/content/rudolph-rudy-marcus\">Pasadena, CA</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://staff.ki.se/people/lars-larsson\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/lasse-150x150.png\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"https://staff.ki.se/people/lars-larsson\">Lars Larsson</a></h3>\n<p>Professor of neurophysiology and group leader of the<br/><a href=\"http://ki.se/en/fyfa/basic-and-clinical-muscle-biology\">Basic and clinical muscle biology</a> <br/>research group at the <br/>Department of Physiology and Pharmacology<br/>Karolinska Institutet</p>",
